'''Poliwrath''' (Japanese: '''ニョロボン''' ''Nyorobon'') is a {{ct|Water}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion.

