==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unbroken Bonds|Poliwrath|39}} from the {{TCG|Unbroken Bonds}} expansion.
*{{DL|Skill (Shuffle)|Counterattack}} is a {{OBP|skill|Shuffle}} in [[Pokémon Shuffle]], though {{p|Poliwrath}} cannot have it.
**As an {{TCG|Ability}} in the TCG, it first appeared as a {{TCG|Pokémon Power}} named '''Strikes Back''' on {{TCG ID|Base Set|Machamp|8}} from the {{TCG|Base Set}}.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Poliwrath}}.
*{{m|Mega Punch}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Poliwrath}} can learn via [[TM]] or [[Move Tutor]].
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

